;SHEET
THE SHEETS PRESENTED AS *AA* AND *BA* ON SHEET RECORDS
BELOW ARE ACTUALLY SIX-STRANDED BETA BARRELS.  THESE ARE
REPRESENTED AS SEVEN-STRANDED SHEETS IN WHICH THE FIRST AND
LAST STRANDS ARE IDENTICAL.
;
